WEBVTT

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:41.882
McGONAGALL:
Potter,

00:00:41.926 --> 00:00:44.668
in light of what has happened...

00:00:45.973 --> 00:00:49.412
if you should have the need
to talk to someone...

00:00:51.109 --> 00:00:55.592
You should know,
Professor Dumbledore...

00:00:57.115 --> 00:00:59.857
you meant a great deal to him.

00:01:17.657 --> 00:01:20.051
HERMIONE:
Do you think
he would've done it?

00:01:20.094 --> 00:01:22.923
Draco?

00:01:22.967 --> 00:01:25.404
No.

00:01:25.448 --> 00:01:28.581
No,
he was lowering his wand.

00:01:28.625 --> 00:01:31.236
In the end,
it was Snape.

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:33.847
It was always Snape.

00:01:33.891 --> 00:01:36.241
And I did nothing.

00:01:42.378 --> 00:01:45.598
It's fake.

00:01:45.642 --> 00:01:47.383
Open it.

00:01:58.045 --> 00:02:00.134
"To the Dark Lord.

00:02:00.178 --> 00:02:02.136
"I know I will be dead
long before you read this,

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:03.616
"but I want you to know
that it was I

00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:06.880
"who discovered your secret.

00:02:06.924 --> 00:02:08.795
"I have stolen the real Horcrux

00:02:08.839 --> 00:02:10.971
"and intend to destroy it
as soon as I can.

00:02:11.015 --> 00:02:14.366
"I face death in the hope
that when you meet your match

00:02:14.410 --> 00:02:16.542
"you will be mortal once more.

00:02:17.717 --> 00:02:20.111
R.A.B."

00:02:20.154 --> 00:02:22.374
R.A.B.

00:02:22.418 --> 00:02:24.028
Don't know.

00:02:25.682 --> 00:02:29.338
But whoever they are,
they have the real Horcrux.

00:02:29.381 --> 00:02:31.035
Which means it was all
a waste.

00:02:32.297 --> 00:02:34.081
All of it.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:42.438
Ron's okay with it,
you know.

00:02:42.481 --> 00:02:44.614
You and Ginny.

00:02:44.657 --> 00:02:46.137
But if I were you,
when he's around,

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:49.619
I'd keep the snogging
to a minimum.

00:02:49.662 --> 00:02:52.839
I'm not coming back,
Hermione.

00:02:52.883 --> 00:02:55.842
I've got to finish
whatever Dumbledore started.

00:02:55.886 --> 00:02:58.715
And I don't know
where that'll lead me,

00:02:58.758 --> 00:03:03.459
but I'll let you and Ron know
where I am when I can.

00:03:03.502 --> 00:03:06.505
I've always admired
your courage, Harry.

00:03:06.549 --> 00:03:09.552
But sometimes,
you can be really thick.

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:14.339
You don't really think
you're going to be able

00:03:14.383 --> 00:03:17.211
to find all those Horcruxes
by yourself, do you?

00:03:21.259 --> 00:03:23.522
You need us, Harry.

00:03:38.755 --> 00:03:42.106
HARRY:
I never realized
how beautiful this place was.

00:03:42.149 --> 00:03:44.325
[♪♪♪]

00:03:44.369 --> 00:03:47.981
[BIRD CRIES]

00:04:31.851 --> 00:04:33.853
[♪♪♪]

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:12.882
[♪♪♪]

